  "description": "Lightweight request and response models for CobaltPDF. Install this package in client applications (web apps, mobile backends, etc.) that send PDF generation requests to a CobaltPDF-powered microservice or Azure Function. No Chromium or Playwright dependency. Build requests with an object initializer or the fluent PdfRequest.ForUrl(...).Build() builder.",
